-- =============================================================================
-- NutriSmart: 044_drj_food_import_and_search_bonus.sql
-- (1) Imports 490 foods from the Dr J "Food Database" sheet into master_foods.
--     carbs = Green carbs + Net carbs ; fat = Mixed fat + Pure fats (same split the sheet uses for calories).
--     Safe to re-run: a food whose name and portion already exist is skipped.
-- (2) One-time AI-search bonus table (replaces the old daily +5 for completed profiles).
-- Additive only.
-- =============================================================================

